    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Streets of Fear</i></strong> is a gritty side scrolling beat 'em up where you play as <u>Phobia</u>, an unhinged force of chaos that stalks the city\u2019s corrupt streets. In this twisted urban battlefield, the cops aren\u2019t protectors, they\u2019re the ones watching their backs. Every alley echoes with dread as <u>Phobia</u> barrels through with relentless fury, leaving fear and broken batons in his wake. In a world where justice is a joke, <strong><i>Streets of Fear</i></strong> lets you become the nightmare they never saw coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713300/extras/f1b58ecd20c70298f3ec9983516394ad.poster.avif?t=1751443001\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713300/extras/f1b58ecd20c70298f3ec9983516394ad.webm?t=1751443001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713300/extras/f1b58ecd20c70298f3ec9983516394ad.mp4?t=1751443001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to contact me at <strong><i><u><a href=\"mailto:fearofstreets@gmail.com\">fearofstreets@gmail.com</a></u></i></strong> with any questions!</p>",
